---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const calendly = 'https://calendly.com/systemsbygee/discovery-call-systems-by-gee-clone';
const title = 'Case Studies | Systems by Gee';
const description = 'Real client results from GoHighLevel builds, rescues, migrations, and automations. See how Gee turns backend chaos into calm.';

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'ProfessionalService',
  name: 'Systems by Gee',
  aggregateRating: { '@type': 'AggregateRating', ratingValue: '5', reviewCount: '4', bestRating: '5' },
  review: [
    { '@type': 'Review', author: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Lori Young' }, reviewBody: 'This time I hired the right person and she came in and immediately fixed my funnels. World of difference when someone is experienced. I am soooooo calm going into launch.', reviewRating: { '@type': 'Rating', ratingValue: '5', bestRating: '5' } },
    { '@type': 'Review', author: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Virtual service provider' }, reviewBody: 'I can recommend Geethika to anyone looking for someone to take over GHL tasks. She is fast learning and you can confidently hire her as your GHL VA. More than the time, I was like, she is there to handle it.', reviewRating: { '@type': 'Rating', ratingValue: '5', bestRating: '5' } },
    { '@type': 'Review', author: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Lori Young' }, reviewBody: 'My team has found the fix for a very complicated affiliate program in High Level. Huge thanks to Systems by Gee for her never ending patience and persistence.', reviewRating: { '@type': 'Rating', ratingValue: '5', bestRating: '5' } },
    { '@type': 'Review', author: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Agency business manager' }, reviewBody: 'I would highly recommend Systems by Gee. She is amazing at this, and has been a blessing for my team.', reviewRating: { '@type': 'Rating', ratingValue: '5', bestRating: '5' } }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} jsonLd={jsonLd}>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Case Studies</span>
      <h1>Real businesses. Real systems. Real calm.</h1>
      <p class="lead">What changes when someone who actually knows the tech steps in and works alongside your business.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--sand">
    <div class="container">

      <article class="case reveal">
        <div class="case-tags"><span class="tag tag--emerald">Funnel rescue</span><span class="tag">GoHighLevel</span></div>
        <h2 class="case-title">A launch-week funnel rescue, with days to spare</h2>
        <p class="case-client">Lori Young, Offer &amp; Positioning Strategist</p>
        <div class="case-highlight">Hired the same day. Went from "I don't trust my setup" to "soooooo calm going into launch."</div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <div><span class="case-label">The challenge</span><p>Launch was less than a week away and Lori did not trust the High Level setup someone had built for her. She went looking, publicly, for a specialist who actually knew the platform inside out.</p></div>
          <div><span class="case-label">What I did</span><p>I reached out the same day, went through her setup as the trusted pair of eyes she needed, and immediately fixed her funnels. No long onboarding, just experienced eyes that found what was off and sorted it in time for launch.</p></div>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="case-quote">"This time I hired the right person and she came in and immediately fixed my funnels. World of difference when someone is experienced."<cite>Lori Young, Offer &amp; Positioning Strategist</cite></blockquote>
      </article>

      <article class="case reveal">
        <div class="case-tags"><span class="tag tag--emerald">Ongoing support</span><span class="tag">Recurring GHL &amp; admin</span></div>
        <h2 class="case-title">12 hours a month back, and room to grow</h2>
        <p class="case-client">A virtual service provider</p>
        <div class="case-highlight">12 hours a month back, around &pound;320 in recovered time, and the freedom to take on new clients.</div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <div><span class="case-label">The challenge</span><p>This solopreneur was drowning in her own admin. The recurring tasks alone ate up 12 hours every month, costing her around &pound;320 in potential revenue. She had never really delegated before.</p></div>
          <div><span class="case-label">What I did</span><p>I stepped in as her first real team member and took the recurring tasks off her plate. I learned her systems fast, optimized as I went, and became the person she could simply hand things to. Not a task-doer. A teammate.</p></div>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="case-quote">"I can recommend Geethika to anyone looking for someone to take over GHL tasks. You can confidently hire her as your GHL VA. More than the time, I was like, she is there to handle it."<cite>A virtual service provider</cite></blockquote>
      </article>

      <article class="case reveal">
        <div class="case-tags"><span class="tag tag--emerald">Custom build</span><span class="tag">Affiliate tracking</span><span class="tag">GoHighLevel</span></div>
        <h2 class="case-title">The affiliate system GHL support said was impossible</h2>
        <p class="case-client">Lori Young, for the Offer X-Ray launch</p>
        <div class="case-highlight">Full affiliate tracking across 3 domains, built natively in GHL. Tested a million times. Held on launch day.</div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <div><span class="case-label">The challenge</span><p>The launch needed a full affiliate program inside High Level, tracking clicks, leads, purchases, and upsells across three separate domains. Time was tight, and GHL's own support said part of it was not possible without an external tool.</p></div>
          <div><span class="case-label">What I did</span><p>I built the whole thing inside GHL, natively. The piece support said needed a third-party tool, I built using my development background, not a workaround that would buckle under launch traffic. This is where being an actual builder changes what is possible.</p></div>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="case-quote">"My team has found the fix for a very complicated affiliate program in High Level. Huge thanks to Systems by Gee for her never ending patience and persistence."<cite>Lori Young, Offer &amp; Positioning Strategist</cite></blockquote>
      </article>

      <article class="case reveal">
        <div class="case-tags"><span class="tag tag--emerald">Automation &amp; design</span><span class="tag">Membership &amp; events</span></div>
        <h2 class="case-title">A membership community that runs its own events</h2>
        <p class="case-client">A membership community</p>
        <div class="case-highlight">Weekly events that run themselves, with rotating emails and designs the client loved.</div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <div><span class="case-label">The challenge</span><p>Every week meant the same manual grind: scheduling event calls, writing emails, sending reminders, managing sign-ups. It all leaned on someone doing it by hand, and the emails were starting to feel repetitive to members.</p></div>
          <div><span class="case-label">What I did</span><p>I automated the whole event engine in GHL, with rotating email templates that change weekly so members never get the same message twice. Then I built the front end: dedicated event pages, polished funnels, and a dedicated attendee portal.</p></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="case reveal">
        <div class="case-tags"><span class="tag tag--emerald">White label</span><span class="tag">Embedded agency support</span></div>
        <h2 class="case-title">The GHL expert an agency made part of the team</h2>
        <p class="case-client">Blueprint and Bloom, agency</p>
        <div class="case-highlight">Became a core, trusted team member. "A blessing for my team."</div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <div><span class="case-label">The challenge</span><p>A growing agency needed real GoHighLevel expertise inside their team, not a one-off contractor to brief and babysit, but someone who could plug in and deliver client work to the agency's standard.</p></div>
          <div><span class="case-label">What I did</span><p>I came in as a core team member and their go-to GHL expert. I fit into their workflow, coordinated with their business manager, and delivered for their clients under their brand. The white-label side of what I do: I make the agency look great.</p></div>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="case-quote">"I would highly recommend Systems by Gee. She is amazing at this, and has been a blessing for my team."<cite>Agency business manager</cite></blockquote>
      </article>

      <article class="case reveal">
        <div class="case-tags"><span class="tag tag--emerald">Migration</span><span class="tag">Dubsado</span><span class="tag">GoHighLevel</span></div>
        <h2 class="case-title">A clean break from Dubsado to GHL, with nothing lost</h2>
        <p class="case-client">A service-based business</p>
        <div class="case-highlight">A full migration with nothing lost, no chaos, and a backend that finally lives under one roof.</div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <div><span class="case-label">The challenge</span><p>The business had outgrown Dubsado, but moving felt risky. That fear keeps most people stuck: losing contacts, breaking automations, or disrupting the client experience halfway through.</p></div>
          <div><span class="case-label">What I did</span><p>I mapped the entire system before touching a thing, then migrated it properly. Contacts, workflows, forms, and history moved into GHL and rebuilt to work better than before, not just copied across.</p></div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h2 style="max-width: 22ch; margin: 0 auto 16px;">Want this kind of calm going into your next launch?</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin: 0 auto 28px;">Start with a free audit and I will tell you exactly where your systems stand.</p>
      <a href={calendly} class="btn btn--secondary">Book a free audit</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
